# FILES

: `/boot/svc/*.ndb`
  The service manifests, in the boot image.
: `/boot/drv/*.ndb`
  The driver manifests.
: `boot/limine.conf`
  Limine's configuration in the repository, for a development image; an installed system's is made from its slot table (slots(6)).
: `/srv/<name>`
  The posts.

